# Line endings are part of this project's correctness, not a preference.
#
# `npm run match` compares contracts/standing.py byte for byte with the source
# the chain returns for the deployed address. Left alone, git rewrites the file
# to CRLF on a Windows checkout and LF elsewhere, so the same commit would give
# two different answers depending on who runs the comparison. Everything is
# stored and checked out with LF, on every machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
